# silent-zero .gitignore
# This repo is PUBLIC. When in doubt, ignore it and commit a small derived file instead.

# --- AI agents and local notes (Claude, Codex, others) ---
.claude/
CLAUDE.md
CLAUDE.local.md
**/CLAUDE.md
AGENTS.md
HANDOFF.md
.codex/
.cursor/
.cursorrules
.aider*
.continue/
.windsurf/
.copilot/
*.local.md
private/
notes/

# --- Secrets and credentials ---
.env
.env.*
!.env.example
.envrc
*.pem
*.key
*.p12
*.pfx
*.crt
*.keystore
*.jks
id_rsa*
id_ed25519*
id_ecdsa*
.netrc
.npmrc
.pypirc
